  "design": {
    "decision": "Turn the run toward [A]s by buying [A]s, become-[A] enablers and untrumpable effects, and in play time [A]s to land before voids appear.",
    "opponent": "Shown on the first [A] win; opponents void suits fast and trump [A]s, and play second-hand low to draw them out.",
    "rationale": "Legendary budget is ×2–×3 broadly: about 2.3 [A] wins a round gives about ×2.2, and it compounds with every [A] the run adds. seed-ace-mult (+9.9 in the pilot) shows [A]-win shapes carry runs, and play-based firing rewards timing over just holding.",
